# Pairs with LeaseEventuallyEnds, under the fairness Spec asserts. A lease
# that never runs out keeps the id of a delete whose caller was lost reserved
# for good, and every capture of identical content waits on it.
MODULE: LeaseEventuallyEndsNeverLapses
TARGET: LeaseEventuallyEnds
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a lost delete's lease never runs out
PERTURBS: DelLapse

--- FIND
DelLapse(d) ==
    /\ del[d] \in {"begun", "art"}
--- REPLACE
DelLapse(d) ==
    \* MUTATION: the lease runs out only once the delete is over.
    /\ del[d] = "done"
--- END
